<section class="mkc">
  <div class="mk-container mkc-inner mk-reveal">
    <span class="mk-eyebrow" style="justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      Bereit für Ihr Event?
    </span>
    <h2 class="mkc-h2">
      Lassen Sie uns Ihre<br />Idee servieren.
    </h2>
    <p class="mkc-body">
      Erzählen Sie uns von Ihrem Anlass — wir melden uns innerhalb von
      24 Stunden mit einem maßgeschneiderten Vorschlag.
    </p>
    <div class="mkc-btns">
      <a href="/catering" class="mk-btn mk-btn-lt">Banketmappe öffnen →</a>
      <a href="/kontakt" class="mk-btn mk-btn-outline-lt">Direkt anfragen</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
.mkc {
  background: var(--mk-bg-deep);
  padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(243,235,220,0.07);
}
.mkc-inner { max-width: 680px; }
.mkc-h2 {
  font-family: var(--mk-serif);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--mk-cream);
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.mkc-body {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: rgba(243,235,220,0.6);
  max-width: 52ch;
  margin-inline: auto;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}
.mkc-btns {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.875rem;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .mkc-btns { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .mkc-btns .mk-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>
